You temporarily merge with your mucus, cleansing yourself of [2, 2, 3, 3, 3 (TL1-5)] physical or magical detrimental effects.

You can then reemerge on any tile within sight and range that is also covered by mucus.

This is quick, performed in only [100%, 82%, 66%, 56%, 48% (TL1-5)] of the normal time, but you must be in contact with your mucus.
